<hr color="#983400">
<p align="left">Welcome to the home of the Beast Master, this is a privately run
site to allow me to explore the avenues of publishing more active web content on
the Internet.</p>
<p align="left">It also allows me to write and publish whatever I want whenever
I like, I was fed up of continually creating site after site on Geocities and
other similar web servers.&nbsp; So I thought it was time to buy my own domain
and get on with it.</p>
<p align="left">There is nothing of a sexual, hacking or cracking nature on this
site, so if that's what your after go somewhere else.</p>
<p align="left">If you want to have a look around please feel free to do so, I
ain't got a problem with it, everything herein has been developed by myself.</p>
<p align="left">If you got any comments send me an e-mail the address is at the
bottom of the page.</p>
<hr color="#983400">
<p align="center">For information on this site contact <a href="mailto:beastmaster@beastmaster.co.uk">beastmaster@BeastMaster.co.uk</a></p>
